        "property_type": "optical",
        "summary": "In methanol (10^-5 mol L^-1, room temperature), complex 1 shows no Eu(III) characteristic emission under λex = 245 nm; observed bands match ligand H2L fluorescence, attributed to inefficient energy transfer and possible solvent quenching.",
